hi i'm evan carmichael and in today's  video i want to answer a question for  one of our readers james  james is a recent graduate from  university with a bachelor of commerce  degree  and he's asking if he should go and get  a job or if he should start his own  business  so whenever giving career advice i  always encourage people to  really trust in their heart and try to  follow their intuition  i can only tell you from my experience  what i did i also had a bachelor of  commerce degree from university  and i was already running my business  when i was in university  and when i was graduating i had a couple  of offers from  fairly large financial organizations and  had to make a decision  do i go take the nice high paying job or  do i  focus on my business and see if i can  make it a big success  and i was looking around and seeing what  my friends were doing and some of them  were going  off into the workforce right away i know  this were taking a year off to travel  find themselves and then get started  working  so i thought i'm going to take a year  off and i'm going to focus on my  business  and see if i can make it really take off  and be build something that i can be  proud of  and if it doesn't work out i can always  come back those opportunities will still  be there for me in a year if i wanted to  go get a job  and worst case scenario i learned a lot  about running the business and now i'm  ready to go get a job i never actually  went back to get a job because our  business did do well  so that's a success story as you get  older i think it's harder to  have the guts to go and start a business  you know once you  have a family you start establishing  roots you have a lot more commitments  it could be harder to start a business  so i encourage young people to  try to start their business as soon as  possible see if entrepreneurship is for  them  and if you take a year off to focus on  that and see if you can make a success  those other opportunities will still be  there for you a year later  if you wanted to go get a job so i hope  that helps if you like the video please  give it a thumbs up below  i'd also love to hear your thoughts and  feedback if you want to leave a comment  and stay tuned for the next video  you
 

